      "detailed_description": "About the game:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a role-playing ARPG game. The player will play Pig Bajie. The background of the plot is that Bai Gujing ate Tang Sanzang, and his skill increased greatly. Sun Wukong was killed alive. Pig Bajie seeks to revive his master and elder martial brother. The plot is rich and interesting, and his brain is wide open, which overturns your understanding of the traditional Western Journey.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCombat system: support unarmed combat, melee weapons, long-range weapons, spell spells<br />\r\n<br />\r\nConstruction system: you can create a warm home<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlanting system: planting various crops<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrading system: you can trade with merchants on the mountain, and you can buy weapon spells from them<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRole: personas with high-precision modeling, various realistic modeling<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlants: high-precision plants, realistic nature<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFuture update direction: plot, various weapons, more buildings and riding systems that will continue to be updated in the future.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can get faster help by posting messages in the community, and you can also put forward suggestions to help us improve and update better",
